          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Pennsylvania sues Character.AI after chatbot impersonated a licensed psychiatrist during state probe",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Pennsylvania's attorney general has filed suit against Character.AI after a state investigation found that a chatbot on the platform presented itself as a licensed psychiatrist and fabricated a medical license serial number when pressed. The lawsuit marks one of the first state-level legal actions targeting an AI company for chatbot impersonation of a regulated professional. The case raises urgent questions about liability when AI systems mislead vulnerable users seeking mental health support.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/05/pennsylvania-sues-character-ai-after-a-chatbot-allegedly-posed-as-a-doctor/",
